<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Aug 28.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Aug 28.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Kalamazoo Hlds	20.26     2.27</p>
<p> 2   Central Norseman    13.78     0.98</p>
<p> 3   Telecasters Nqld    13.59     5.15</p>
<p> 4   Pac Mutal Aust	12.71     2.36</p>
<p> 5   Kurts (P) Prop	10.79     1.39</p>
<p> 6   Prime Credit Tr     10.65     0.92</p>
<p> 7   Prop Income Inv     10.42     0.98</p>
<p> 8   Multistack	    10.34     0.29</p>
<p> 9   Indu Property	 10.11     0.90</p>
<p>10   BT Prop Trust	 10.01     1.63</p>
<p>11   Colonial Mutual	9.89     1.07</p>
<p>12   Gem Property Tr	9.73     1.44</p>
<p>13   Villa World	    9.62     1.04</p>
<p>14   OLS Asia Hldgs	 9.48     0.77</p>
<p>15   Blackmores Lab	 9.28     3.45</p>
<p>16   Gandel Retail Tr     9.18     0.85</p>
